  "title": "Rachael&#39;s Superheated Cajun Boiled Peanuts",
  "description": "Slow-cooked peanuts are boiled with Cajun seasoning, crab boil, pepper flakes, and jalapeños, resulting in a zesty snack found in the heart of Florida.",
